    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/bandicam-2019-11-22-23-37-47-400.gif?t=1715049428\" /></div><br>Hello, dear potential player! I made a little Platformer game in which I implemented some of my ideas. Fair to say that I'm not a professional in game design and I work alone so I couldn't make everything I wanted. Nevertheless, you're gonna have:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7ac5e7195c0caf462be61bbf3e4af238.poster.avif?t=1715049428\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7ac5e7195c0caf462be61bbf3e4af238.webm?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7ac5e7195c0caf462be61bbf3e4af238.mp4?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Comfortable controls &amp; Impact<br></li><li> Diversity of movement mechanics<br></li><li> A lot of cool levels<br></li><li> Enjoyable minimalistic visual style<br></li><li> Total absence of the fourth wall<br></li><li> Funny story line</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7fa19078e21fc2ffa7b7a58482432a72.poster.avif?t=1715049428\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7fa19078e21fc2ffa7b7a58482432a72.webm?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7fa19078e21fc2ffa7b7a58482432a72.mp4?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Also about the story line! The idea is that various bloggers invaded the game and for different spoiled a nice and simple adventure by adding tons of deadly traps! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/0e8ab02a90e0ef9fd81324e1966095a1.poster.avif?t=1715049428\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/0e8ab02a90e0ef9fd81324e1966095a1.webm?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/0e8ab02a90e0ef9fd81324e1966095a1.mp4?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>By the way, one of the main characters is me! If you try my little experiment I will be grateful! See you in the game!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/bandicam-2019-11-22-23-37-47-400.gif?t=1715049428\" /></div><br>Hello, dear potential player! I made a little Platformer game in which I implemented some of my ideas. Fair to say that I'm not a professional in game design and I work alone so I couldn't make everything I wanted. Nevertheless, you're gonna have:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7ac5e7195c0caf462be61bbf3e4af238.poster.avif?t=1715049428\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7ac5e7195c0caf462be61bbf3e4af238.webm?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7ac5e7195c0caf462be61bbf3e4af238.mp4?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Comfortable controls &amp; Impact<br></li><li> Diversity of movement mechanics<br></li><li> A lot of cool levels<br></li><li> Enjoyable minimalistic visual style<br></li><li> Total absence of the fourth wall<br></li><li> Funny story line</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7fa19078e21fc2ffa7b7a58482432a72.poster.avif?t=1715049428\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7fa19078e21fc2ffa7b7a58482432a72.webm?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/7fa19078e21fc2ffa7b7a58482432a72.mp4?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Also about the story line! The idea is that various bloggers invaded the game and for different spoiled a nice and simple adventure by adding tons of deadly traps! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/0e8ab02a90e0ef9fd81324e1966095a1.poster.avif?t=1715049428\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/0e8ab02a90e0ef9fd81324e1966095a1.webm?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200450/extras/0e8ab02a90e0ef9fd81324e1966095a1.mp4?t=1715049428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>By the way, one of the main characters is me! If you try my little experiment I will be grateful! See you in the game!",
